step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a best_single strategy using ETS, the top-ranked model, to see if a single strong model outperforms selective ensembles.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Evaluate a median combination over the stable pool1 to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a DBA (divide‑by‑average) combination on pool2 to see if a more sophisticated weighted average improves over the mean pool1 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool2 to see if adding rf and catboost improves over pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a median combination over the larger pool3 to see if adding the CWT_rf model improves performance over pool2.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean combination on the full pool3 (9 models) to see if trimming improves over the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","catboost","CWT_rf"],"trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination over pool4 to see if adding catboost and CWT_rf improves over pool3 mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the larger pool3 to see if iterative refinement beats the median result.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple median over the slightly larger pool4 to see if adding CWT_rf improves the selective median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it beats the median pool3 result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a DBA ensemble on the more diverse pool4 to see if adding catboost/CWT improves over pool1 DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool3 using inverse_error weighting to see if it beats the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","catboost","CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

